"    | Runtime environment | Python | `{{ release_image_python_version }}` | "
"Python version used by the validated release image |"
msgstr ""
"    | 运行环境 | Python | `{{ release_image_python_version }}` | "
"经验证的发布镜像所使用的Python版本 |"

msgid ""
"    | Host enablement | Ascend HDK | See <a "
"href=\"https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/{{ "
