msgid ""
"    | Ascend runtime | CANN Toolkit + Ops | `{{ release_cann_version }}` | "
"Ascend user-space runtime and hardware operator packages |"
msgstr ""
"    | 昇腾运行时 | CANN Toolkit + Ops | `{{ release_cann_version }}` | "
"昇腾用户态运行时和硬件算子包 |"

msgid ""
"    | Ascend runtime | NNAL | `{{ release_nnal_version }}` | Provides "
